Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:41.27,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,{\fs23}This stone is truly remarkable. It can even create things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.04,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,A chimera...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:47.74,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Now go! Bite and tear them apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:10.17,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,{\fs22}What are you doing?! Stop playing around and bite his arm right off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.47,0:01:17.67,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, cat bastard? Savor the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:28.98,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,Rose... look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:39.96,Helvetica,,0,0,2,,{\fs22}This is the form of a sinner who violated human transmutation\Nand trespassed into what they call God's domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:47.60,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,The Steel Knight... Automail... T-That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:53.61,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,The Fullmetal Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:55.09,Helvetica,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1480)}The Fullmetal Alchemist!
